  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">簡介 :</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模組為你的主世界增添了多種建築與地牢，豐富你的探索體驗。這些地牢內設計了怪物生成器以及裝有戰利品的箱子，提供資源並創造與環境互動的機會。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🌳 叢林巨樹</li>\n<li>🏯 荒廢的橡木宮殿</li>\n<li>🏰 優化版叢林神殿</li>\n<li>🏰 The&nbsp;沼澤神殿</li>\n<li>🏜️ 沙漠神殿（屍骸）</li>\n<li>🏰 殭屍塔</li>\n<li>🍄 荒廢的蘑菇島</li>\n<li>🏚️ 廢棄工廠</li>\n<li>🏰 女巫城堡&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器 :</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 模組載入器，涵蓋從 1.16.5 到 Minecraft 最新版本。請瀏覽下方連結以選擇您偏好的載入器版本：</p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點擊這裡🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/forge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點擊這裡🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必要模組 :</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">請務必安裝以下模組，它們對專案的正常運作及完整體驗至關重要。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Library Ferret </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">相關連結 :</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">尋找我們的資源並加入社群：</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Link Tree </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 GitHub </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/197/bh_ad_see.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-nether-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/192/bh_ad_nether.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-the-end-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/190/bh_ad_end.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/193/bh_ad_ocean.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴 :</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案獲 BisectHosting 榮譽贊助。歡迎前往了解他們的服務，以高品質與穩定性輕鬆託管您的專案。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行動呼籲 :</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有任何問題嗎？需要幫助嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord 或前往 GitHub，與社群一同參與並貢獻心力！</p>",
